sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HQ as Authorized HQ operator
    actor HH as Household resident
    actor R as Rescuer / team leader
    participant API as RESQPERATION API
    participant DB as Scoped operational and shared tables
    participant Notify as Push provider
    participant Partner as Partner systems
    HQ->>API: Authenticate and access permitted modules
    API->>DB: Verify account, role and access scope
    HQ->>API: Declare event and publish alert with report-status choices
    API->>DB: Store event and broadcast
    API->>Notify: Submit configured notification delivery
    Notify-->>HH: Alert when device delivery succeeds
    HH->>API: Submit own or authorized trusted-member safety status
    API->>DB: Validate event, member and status, save history
    HQ->>API: Review affected households and dispatch available team
    API->>DB: Save assignment and operational history
    R->>API: Load own assignment, route and household details
    R->>API: Update progress, record location and submit member assessments
    API->>DB: Persist field findings and current safety state
    opt Team leader requests logistics
        R->>API: Submit personnel, equipment or supply request
        API->>DB: Record pending request
        HQ->>API: Authorized validation and forwarding decision
        API->>Partner: Forward to configured TrackingAid connection
        Partner-->>API: Handoff or fulfillment status when available
    end
    opt Generate situation report
        HQ->>API: Select event, scope and report sections
        API->>DB: Read recorded operational evidence
        API->>Partner: Request configured external report data
        API-->>HQ: Saved report and export for manual escalation
    end
    opt API or network unavailable
        Note over HH,R: Mobile restores last-synced pages and shows Offline mode
        Note over HH,R: Page caching does not queue household status submissions
    end
